# Keep the image minimal and secret-free. The repo is public, but defense-in-depth:
# never ship local data, env files, caches, tests, docs, or VCS metadata.
.git
.gitignore
.githooks
node_modules
data
.cache
*.db
*.db-*
.env
.env.*
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.mjs
test
docs
deploy
releases
README.md
CLAUDE.md
*.log
.DS_Store
